[h2]Build 0.9.118[/h2]
[h3]Changed[/h3]
[list]
[*][b]Lighter work scan for "most damaged", "most valuable" and "least valuable" mend orders.[/b] A bill set to one of these used to rank every damaged item in range each time a colonist looked for work. The ranking is now kept for a moment and reused, so busy colonies with a lot of worn gear spend less time on it. Which item gets picked is unchanged.
[*][b]Repair centre uses less texture memory.[/b] Its three sprites are stored at 768x768 instead of 1152x1152, well under half the memory, with no visible difference in game.
[/list]
[list]
[*]No gameplay changes. Safe to update mid-save.
[/list]
